1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,700
Accounts, stock and GST for Indian shops — on the website and an Android app.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:11,700
Anyone can sign up and set up their business. Each business's data is kept separate.

3
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:17,700
Today's sales, cash and bank, money due and low stock — at a glance.

4
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:24,200
Pick items and quantities. CGST + SGST or IGST is chosen automatically.

5
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:30,200
The same app in a phone browser, in light or dark mode.

6
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:36,200
Print or share an invoice with your logo, HSN codes and the tax split.

7
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:42,700
Take a photo of a bill. The app reads it and fills the purchase for you to check.

8
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:49,200
Items with photos, units, GST rates and reorder levels. Stock is always calculated, never typed.

9
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:55,200
Record damaged, lost or found stock with a reason, or count what is on the shelf.

10
00:00:55,800 --> 00:01:01,700
Load items and customers from a CSV file. Every row is checked before anything is saved.

11
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:07,700
Gross and net profit for any period, with opening and closing stock.

12
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:13,700
What the business owns and owes. Day Book, Trial Balance and GST Summary too.

13
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:19,200
Check every report on the phone.

14
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:25,700
Remind customers on WhatsApp, SMS or email — English, Hindi or Hinglish, with your UPI ID.

15
00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:31,700
Cancelled bills, low stock, new team members and a daily summary.

16
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:38,200
Invite staff as Admin, Accountant, Cashier or Viewer. Each sees only what their role allows.

17
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:44,200
See every device where you are signed in, and sign any of them out.

18
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:50,700
A plain-language summary of your shop. It can run on your own computer with Ollama or LM Studio.

19
00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:56,200
Every word explained: ledger, voucher, GST, HSN, and more.

